        "official_en_sha256": "f990faf7eb58bb746b8c7f8a847b958eeac84924c466e770d7c653424dedbe22"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "かつて、魔道士たちの魔力を束ねる術のために\r\n造られた塔じゃ。\r\n今はその役目を終えているがな。",
        "official_en": "’Twas built to bind the magic possessed by mages together. It has not been used to that end for quite a while, however.",
        "real_en": "This tower was built to bring the magical power of mages together. It no longer serves that purpose, though."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
